│   └── crates/ schemas/ fixtures/ examples/ skill/ docs/
├── bearing/               Bearing — public browser control room [git: alphazede/bearing]
│   └── src/ skills/ plugin-skills/ hooks/ examples/ test/
├── developers/            Public reviewed developer assets    [git: alphazede/developers]
│   └── az-sports-dev/ grok-safe/ window/ docs/
├── Alphazedehq/           Portfolio / chief-of-staff repo     [git: alphazede/Alphazedehq]
